                        ],
                        "form": "boomerangs"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "5bd4cdef-84d5-4809-8063-0ffeced258bd",
                        "entry_id": "ff970d3e-678f-37bc-9d6f-2736fad23516",
                        "tags": [
                            "Très rare"
                        ],
                        "form": "boomérang"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ac28747a-95da-315a-8d28-322fc99e0173",
                        "entry_id": "ff970d3e-678f-37bc-9d6f-2736fad23516",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Arme d’attaque directe ou indirecte de vols d’oiseaux, apte à revenir à son lanceur si elle ne touche rien."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea179a32-6ec5-4218-b94b-ea4053b88242",
                                "sense_id": "ac28747a-95da-315a-8d28-322fc99e0173",
                                "text": "– Le criminel revient toujours au lieu de son crime, comme le boomerang aux pieds de son maître."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7898a480-db12-44d6-bea6-9d8e683a37ab",
                                "sense_id": "ac28747a-95da-315a-8d28-322fc99e0173",
                                "text": "Tout ce que fait la Vie, c’est de nous ramener au point de départ, comme un boomerang : nous sommes lancés, nous sommes rappelés."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9c96471c-a484-38bc-af48-902685e0041f",
                        "entry_id": "ff970d3e-678f-37bc-9d6f-2736fad23516",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Jeu sportif où l’on lance un objet analogue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "11cf1053-0a1f-331f-b765-e40b4e380454",
                        "entry_id": "ff970d3e-678f-37bc-9d6f-2736fad23516",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action qui se retourne contre son auteur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c815a86d-68dc-42ba-ae9d-5fbd5e3118b5",
                                "sense_id": "11cf1053-0a1f-331f-b765-e40b4e380454",
                                "text": "Son initiative militaire du 4 novembre 2020 contre un gouvernement régional rétif, rebelle, tenté par la sédition, voire la séparation, a fait complètement boomerang."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7f03a61-4fe2-412f-a022-61774bb870ed",
                                "sense_id": "11cf1053-0a1f-331f-b765-e40b4e380454",
                                "text": "Le problème, pour lui, c’est que son boomerang tarifaire lui est revenu en plein visage ces derniers jours, gracieuseté du marché obligataire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7489ed1-d99c-4512-b44c-3f743df8003b",
                                "sense_id": "11cf1053-0a1f-331f-b765-e40b4e380454",
                                "text": "Son attaque a fait boomerang, a eu un effet boomerang."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c61176ef-0c83-441c-87a7-f42c74084b7a",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff970d3e-678f-37bc-9d6f-2736fad23516",
                        "target_lang_word": "Bumerang",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bumerang",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff814466-cf53-376d-ae99-3ce8e63a3701",
                                        "entry_id": "97b4cb01-1b52-331a-8e95-11e1cd308901",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "flacher Wurfgegenstand, der so geformt ist, dass er in einem Bogenwurf zum Werfer zurückkehrt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0729917-c074-4c6c-ade9-9886bbdfddd0",
                                                "sense_id": "ff814466-cf53-376d-ae99-3ce8e63a3701",
                                                "text": "Er wirft den Bumerang und fängt ihn genau an derselben Stelle, wo er ihn geworfen hatte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b3ddafb-896d-49c5-82d7-717baa8b365e",
                                                "sense_id": "ff814466-cf53-376d-ae99-3ce8e63a3701",
                                                "text": "„Ich wollte das nachmachen, aber bei mir flog der Bumerang in ein Dornengestrüpp, und da kriegte ich ihn nicht mehr raus.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56568bb8-36c8-3022-a621-bc3aa7916869",
                                        "entry_id": "97b4cb01-1b52-331a-8e95-11e1cd308901",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "etwas, das nach einiger Zeit unbeabsichtigt auf den Verursacher zurückfällt, weil es nicht den gewünschten oder den gegenteiligen Effekt erzielt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figurative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "accba6af-54f0-45a7-9611-c19fef22061e",
                                                "sense_id": "56568bb8-36c8-3022-a621-bc3aa7916869",
                                                "text": "Diese Strategie könnte sich langfristig als Bumerang entpuppen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f76bf948-b84a-4388-ba62-d887a6e57669",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff970d3e-678f-37bc-9d6f-2736fad23516",
                        "target_lang_word": "boomerang",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "boomerang",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50fec31e-7162-3a77-9568-46a2d43a84f2",
                                        "entry_id": "7895d8c7-a1c5-3700-8467-9c72ea51f284",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A flat curved airfoil that spins about an axis perpendicular to the direction of flight, originally used in various parts of the world as a hunting weapon or, in returnable types, for sports or training."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ecc6228-b8fe-4b2e-bbfa-694e5a51879e",
                                                "sense_id": "50fec31e-7162-3a77-9568-46a2d43a84f2",
                                                "text": "Some resemblance to terrestrial things, it is true, everyone can behold in the heavens. Corona, for example, is like a crown, or, as the Australian black fellows know, it is like a boomerang, and we can understand why they give it the name of that curious curved missile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3c51732-705b-47bb-9f1f-7e295401c20a",
                                                "sense_id": "50fec31e-7162-3a77-9568-46a2d43a84f2",
                                                "text": "With boomerang and spear they hunted the kangaroo and emu, and fought their battles beneath the eucalyptus forests; their minds, fresh, untroubled, contented, oblivious alike of noble ideals and philosophic principles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cefcb3a-cf8b-42a4-ade6-abe4fd1df796",
                                                "sense_id": "50fec31e-7162-3a77-9568-46a2d43a84f2",
                                                "text": "1961, Charlie Drake, song, My Boomerang Won't Come Back,\n\"Don't worry, boy, I know the trick, / And to you I'm gonna show it. / If you want your boomerang to come back, / Well first you've got to... throw it.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "098ea9e4-8b95-37c2-a503-8290be194704",
                                        "entry_id": "7895d8c7-a1c5-3700-8467-9c72ea51f284",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A breakdancing move in which the performer walks on their hands while keeping the legs raised off the ground."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ffcbe59-93a4-38f9-aca1-cef3fc6053d3",
                                        "entry_id": "7895d8c7-a1c5-3700-8467-9c72ea51f284",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A boomerang kick."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e06a6934-c65f-35fd-8a41-5326c6b22e78",
                                        "entry_id": "7895d8c7-a1c5-3700-8467-9c72ea51f284",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device for changing the color of a followspot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "677c1295-9264-4c1c-9d38-8b656d711a06",
                                                "sense_id": "e06a6934-c65f-35fd-8a41-5326c6b22e78",
                                                "text": "Roll: A live action changing from one color to another. Typically requires dexterity to \"crossfade\" between two colors in the boomerang with one hand while following with the other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e25ef5a0-c9ee-4c69-835d-d8331e4b5d19",
                                                "sense_id": "e06a6934-c65f-35fd-8a41-5326c6b22e78",
                                                "text": "If you are spot one you should push down on the first lever on the boomerang to load frame one. Spot two should do the same with frame five. On the go, both spot ops should run their dowser levers to bring the light up on the target specified by the cue caller."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b3ba253-ef7a-36a7-b272-d6eb1a99e31e",
                                        "entry_id": "7895d8c7-a1c5-3700-8467-9c72ea51f284",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The early return of an aircraft whose mission was aborted, often due to technical failures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a8c9061-7fe8-464e-9728-48df3247243d",
                                                "sense_id": "9b3ba253-ef7a-36a7-b272-d6eb1a99e31e",
                                                "text": "For quotations using this term, see Citations:boomerang."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d64cf8d-20f1-3665-bca8-3547a50a8482",
                                        "entry_id": "7895d8c7-a1c5-3700-8467-9c72ea51f284",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cocktail made with rye whiskey and Swedish punsch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
